---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const metadata = {
  "title": "聯絡我 | 蔡泓恩 | 職能治療師",
  "description": "聯絡蔡泓恩，討論職能治療、視覺復健、數位健康與專案合作。",
  "socialTitle": "聯絡我｜蔡泓恩 職能治療師",
  "path": "/contact",
  "schema": {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "Person",
        "@id": "https://ian030590.trainerhub.cc/#person",
        "name": "蔡泓恩",
        "alternateName": [
          "Hung-En (Ian) Tsai",
          "Ian Tsai",
          "蔡泓恩 職能治療師"
        ],
        "jobTitle": "職能治療師",
        "url": "https://ian030590.trainerhub.cc/",
        "image": "https://ian030590.trainerhub.cc/assets/ian-tsai.jpg",
        "email": "rainbowh9490@gmail.com",
        "sameAs": [
          "https://github.com/ian030590",
          "https://trainerhub.cc"
        ],
        "alumniOf": {
          "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity",
          "name": "國立臺灣大學"
        },
        "knowsAbout": [
          "職能治療",
          "視覺復健",
          "數位健康",
          "居家復能"
        ]
      },
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          {
            "@type": "ListItem",
            "position": 1,
            "name": "首頁",
            "item": "/"
          },
          {
            "@type": "ListItem",
            "position": 2,
            "name": "聯絡我",
            "item": "/contact"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
};
---
<SiteLayout {...metadata}>
    <main class="page-main contact-page">
      <div class="container">
        <section class="contact-hero" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
          <div class="contact-hero-copy">
            <p class="section-kicker">聯絡與合作</p>
            <h1 id="contact-title" class="page-title">聯絡蔡泓恩</h1>
            <p class="page-intro">
              如果你想討論職能治療、視覺復健、數位健康工具或研究合作，歡迎透過以下方式聯絡我。
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="contact-availability" aria-label="聯絡方式摘要">
            <span class="contact-availability-label">最直接的方式</span>
            <a href="mailto:rainbowh9490@gmail.com">rainbowh9490@gmail.com</a>
            <p>適合合作邀請、研究交流與專案討論。</p>
          </aside>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-stats" aria-label="聯絡服務指標">
          <article class="contact-stat"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">schedule</span><div><span class="contact-stat-label">回應速度</span><strong>24-48 hrs</strong><small>臨床與技術諮詢常態回覆</small></div></article>
          <article class="contact-stat"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">lock</span><div><span class="contact-stat-label">資料安全性</span><strong>Zero-Cloud</strong><small>嚴格端點隔離與安全沙盒</small></div></article>
          <article class="contact-stat"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">folder_code</span><div><span class="contact-stat-label">開源代碼庫</span><strong>AGPL-3.0 Licensed</strong><small>以社群健康福祉為核心</small></div></article>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-workspace" aria-label="聯絡與合作資訊">
          <div class="contact-sidebar">
            <section class="contact-panel contact-channels" aria-labelledby="contact-routes-title">
              <div class="contact-panel-heading">
                <h2 id="contact-routes-title"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">contact_mail</span>直接聯絡管道</h2>
                <span class="contact-badge">DIRECT</span>
              </div>
              <p class="contact-channel-intro"><strong>選擇適合的聯絡方式</strong> 每個入口都會直接連到正確的聯絡管道，無需填寫冗長資料。</p>
              <div class="contact-channel-list">
                <a class="contact-channel" href="mailto:rainbowh9490@gmail.com"><span class="contact-channel-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">alternate_email</span></span><span><small>Email · 合作與研究交流</small><strong>電子郵件信箱 · rainbowh9490@gmail.com</strong><em>請說明您的背景、想討論的主題與可聯繫的時間。</em></span><span class="contact-channel-action">寄送電子郵件</span></a>
                <a class="contact-channel" href="https://github.com/ian030590" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="contact-channel-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">terminal</span></span><span><small>GitHub · 查看開源專案</small><strong>開源專案與代碼庫 · github.com/ian030590</strong></span><span class="contact-channel-action">前往 GitHub</span></a>
                <a class="contact-channel" href="https://trainerhub.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="contact-channel-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">neurology</span></span><span><small>復能訓練實機平台</small><strong>trainerhub.cc</strong></span><span class="material-symbols-outlined contact-channel-arrow" aria-hidden="true">arrow_outward</span></a>
                <a class="contact-channel" href="tel:0937809968"><span class="contact-channel-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">call</span></span><span><small>電話 · 需要即時溝通</small><strong>0937-809-968</strong></span><span class="contact-channel-action">撥打電話</span></a>
                <div class="contact-channel"><span class="contact-channel-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span></span><span><small>所在地點與研究機構</small><strong>台灣台北市 · 國立臺灣大學 (National Taiwan University)</strong></span></div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="contact-panel contact-scope" aria-labelledby="scope-title">
              <div class="contact-panel-heading"><h2 id="scope-title"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">tune</span>交流與合作範疇</h2><span class="contact-panel-note">領域指南</span></div>
              <ul class="contact-scope-list">
                <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">sports_esports</span><span><strong>數位復能與認知訓練系統</strong><small>jsPsych 實驗範式、PWA 離線訓練、動作／視覺／認知臨床量化分析。</small></span></li>
                <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">auto_mode</span><span><strong>臨床與研究自動化工作流</strong><small>PubMed 結構化自動檢索、Zotero AI 摘要、n8n 排程自動化管道。</small></span></li>
                <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">desktop_windows</span><span><strong>醫療小工具與桌面應用開發</strong><small>Chrome 擴充功能、Electron + React 19 跨平台端點應用與批次本機處理。</small></span></li>
                <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">campaign</span><span><strong>演講分享與臨床工作坊</strong><small>數位健康賦能實踐、醫療人員無痛開源程式設計培力講座。</small></span></li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <aside class="contact-ethics"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span><div><strong>醫療倫理與隱私承諾</strong><p>任何交流討論涉及之臨床病例、機構內部數據或敏感研發設想均予以最高等級保密。純本機執行架構絕不上傳無授權之病患個資。</p></div></aside>
          </div>

          <section class="contact-inquiry contact-panel" aria-labelledby="message-title">
          <div class="contact-section-intro">
            <p class="section-kicker">留下訊息 · ONLINE INQUIRY FORM</p>
            <h2 id="message-title">先簡單說說您的需求</h2>
            <p>送出後會開啟您的郵件應用程式，內容會預先帶入。</p>
          </div>
          <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form" aria-describedby="contact-form-note">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="sender-name">姓名／組織</label>
              <input id="sender-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="如：林治療師 / Dr. Chen" required />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="sender-role">您的專業背景</label>
              <select id="sender-role" name="role" required>
                <option value="" selected disabled>請選擇您的身分背景</option>
                <option>職能／物理／語言治療師</option>
                <option>臨床醫師／護理／醫事人員</option>
                <option>學術研究員／大專院校教授</option>
                <option>軟體工程師／技術開發者</option>
                <option>生技／數位健康產業夥伴</option>
                <option>其他合作洽詢</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="sender-email">電子郵件信箱</label>
              <input id="sender-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@institution.org" required />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="message-subject">主旨</label>
              <select id="message-subject" name="subject" required>
                <option value="" selected disabled>請選擇諮詢類別</option>
                <option>數位復能系統客製建置 (trainerhub / 評估工具)</option>
                <option>臨床研究自動化流程整合 (PubMed / Zotero / n8n)</option>
                <option>開源專案技術交流與代碼貢獻</option>
                <option>專題講座、工作坊與演講邀約</option>
                <option>其他商業或臨床合作探討</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form-chips" aria-label="諮詢需求範本">
              <span>快速填入諮詢需求範本：</span>
              <button type="button" data-message-chip="復能遊戲客製化">+ 復能遊戲客製化</button>
              <button type="button" data-message-chip="文獻與臨床自動化">+ 文獻與臨床自動化</button>
              <button type="button" data-message-chip="演講邀約洽商">+ 演講邀約洽商</button>
            </div>
            <div class="field field-message">
              <label for="message-body">訊息內容</label>
              <textarea id="message-body" name="body" placeholder="請詳述您想探討的臨床需求、目前遇到的工作流瓶頸、期望合作的模式或預計進行的研究項目..." required></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form-footer">
              <p id="contact-form-note"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">lock</span>訊息不會儲存在本網站。</p>
              <button class="button-primary has-animated-icon" type="submit">
                開啟郵件軟體
                <span class="animate-icon animate-icon--send" data-animate-icon="send" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>
          </section>
        </section>
        <section class="contact-faq contact-panel" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
          <div class="contact-section-intro">
            <p class="section-kicker"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">help</span> FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</p>
            <h2 id="faq-title">常見諮詢與合作問題解答</h2>
            <p>在您正式聯繫前，這裡整理了臨床同仁與技術夥伴最常詢問的關鍵疑問。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-faq-grid">
            <article class="contact-faq-card"><span class="contact-faq-number">01</span><h3>是否提供臨床機構或治療所的客製化評估系統建置？</h3><p>是的。可針對臨床科別（如神經復健、小兒發展、長照認知促進）進行專屬量測指標客製化，支援眼動刺激、手部精細動作追蹤與標準化反應時間測量，所有資料皆能匯出為符合研究規範的 CSV / JSON 格式。</p><strong><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>支援本機離線與無資料外洩部署</strong></article>
            <article class="contact-faq-card"><span class="contact-faq-number">02</span><h3>居家訓練網 (trainerhub.cc) 的遊戲如何安全部署？</h3><p>平台採 5 重多層防禦架構：包含獨立遊戲子網域、極致受限的 Iframe Sandbox、MessageChannel 專屬安全雙向管道，以及單一遊戲可轉化為獨立 PWA 安裝。臨床個案無須安裝可疑執行檔，隨開隨練。</p><strong><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">shield</span>CSP 嚴格防護與沙盒隔離機制</strong></article>
            <article class="contact-faq-card"><span class="contact-faq-number">03</span><h3>辦公自動化工具（如 NTUHNotifier、文獻追蹤）是否有開放原始碼？</h3><p>絕大多數工具均在 GitHub (ian030590) 完全開源。NTUHNotifier 門診通知擴充、PDF 萬用轉換解鎖工具與 ResearchAssistant n8n 檢索工作流皆附有詳細的原始碼與部署說明文件，歡迎自由 Fork 與修改。</p><strong><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">code</span>AGPL-3.0 授權 · 鼓勵社群二次開發</strong></article>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
</SiteLayout>
